description: AI collaboration workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

When implementing features:

- Read relevant documentation in `/docs` before making changes.
- Implement only the requested feature or phase.
- Do not add unrelated features.
- Preserve existing architecture and coding conventions.
- If information is missing, ask for clarification instead of making assumptions.
- Prefer incremental, reviewable changes over large rewrites.
- Keep generated code production-ready and well-typed.